{"about_the_game":"iCorp is a tycoon game where you establish and manage your own company. Manufacture any product from the hundreds available in the game, build factories, set up production processes, buy and upgrade machinery, and take control over everything related to large company operations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537630/extras/53752ba71eff12d6c9498363f41f25dc.avif?t=1712931469\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537630/extras/aab295b39232fbab82b92f9954796e01.poster.avif?t=1712931469\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537630/extras/aab295b39232fbab82b92f9954796e01.webm?t=1712931469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537630/extras/aab295b39232fbab82b92f9954796e01.mp4?t=1712931469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Build your factories from the ground up using a powerful, yet intuitive, modular system. Design the lighting and ventilation and placement of furnishings to increase employee satisfaction.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537630/extras/18a9f6768530ec29648497713eed7fe2.avif?t=1712931469\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537630/extras/97610c18766bb228b6ed20877b07f03d.poster.avif?t=1712931469\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537630/extras/97610c18766bb228b6ed20877b07f03d.webm?t=1712931469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537630/extras/97610c18766bb228b6ed20877b07f03d.mp4?t=1712931469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Buy, upgrade, and maintain production machinery to maximize the speed and efficiency of production processes. Observe even the most minute detail of each machine, its movement and what its job entails.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537630/extras/eda932d957c719afd651c74f29d426a6.avif?t=1712931469\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537630/extras/0c1590eb566588d764fc9a93c32b14d2.poster.avif?t=1712931469\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537630/extras/0c1590eb566588d764fc9a93c32b14d2.webm?t=1712931469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537630/extras/0c1590eb566588d764fc9a93c32b14d2.mp4?t=1712931469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Buy material, manage production and make sure that everything works as efficiently as possible. Whenever a machine is idle, you lose money!<br><br>Satisfied staff work faster and are more efficient. Think about this when paying wages and building a functional working environment. You don't want your employees to go on strike, do you?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537630/extras/fbf935cbc91e1b10a4c27ca9049cae36.avif?t=1712931469\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1537630/extras/fdb4501be65